{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts/issues/1222","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts/issues/1222/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts/issues/1222/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts/issues/1222/events","html_url":"https://github.com/locationtech/jts/issues/1222","id":5120439189,"node_id":"I_kwDOAwCWjs8AAAABMTOzlQ","number":1222,"title":"OverlayNG difference operation moves points in outer edge","user":{"login":"ianturton","id":122529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjUyOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton","html_url":"https://github.com/ianturton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ianturton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-08-11T13:00:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T12:36:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Stepping through the code the change in point locations occurs in `GeometryOverlay` in the JTS code base. `isOverLayNG` is set to `true` so `OverlayNGRobust.overlay` is used. The two input geometries are:\n\n```\nPOLYGON ((412023.08 92158.29, 412021.68 92161.6, 412022.58 92161.96, 412021.45 \n92164.58, 412022.19 92165.38, 412021.43 92167.13, 412018.32 92165.86, 412016.28 \n92165.03, 412019.75 92156.92, 412023.08 92158.29))\n```\nand a negative (-0.5m) buffer of it:\n\n```\nPOLYGON ((412022.4 92158.6, 412020 92157.6, 412016.9 92164.8, 412021.2 92166.5, \n412021.6 92165.5, 412021.1 92164.9, 412021 92164.8, 412021 92164.7, 412021 \n92164.6, 412021 92164.5, 412021 92164.4, 412021.9 92162.2, 412021.5 92162.1, \n412021.4 92162, 412021.3 92162, 412021.3 92161.9, 412021.2 92161.8, 412021.2 \n92161.7, 412021.2 92161.6, 412021.2 92161.5, 412021.2 92161.4, 412022.4 \n92158.6))\n```\nare differenced to give a bordered polygon. which results in:\n\n```\nPOLYGON ((412019.8 92156.9, 412016.3 92165, 412018.3 92165.9, 412021.4 92167.1, \n412022.2 92165.4, 412021.5 92164.6, 412022.6 92162, 412021.7 92161.6, 412023.1 \n92158.3, 412019.8 92156.9), (412021.2 92161.4, 412021.2 92161.5, 412021.2 \n92161.6, 412021.2 92161.7, 412021.2 92161.8, 412021.3 92161.9, 412021.3 92162, \n412021.4 92162, 412021.5 92162.1, 412021.9 92162.2, 412021 92164.4, 412021 \n92164.5, 412021 92164.6, 412021 92164.7, 412021 92164.8, 412021.1 92164.9, \n412021.6 92165.5, 412021.2 92166.5, 412016.9 92164.8, 412020 92157.6, 412022.4 \n92158.6, 412021.2 92161.4))\n```\n\nSome of the points in the outer polygon are moved for no reason.\n\n<img width=\"1306\" height=\"939\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b68f56fc-f8d4-4e44-871f-830fd2818681\" />\n\nReverting to isOverlayNG=false solves this issue.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts/issues/1222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/locationtech/jts/issues/1222/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}